        "original_id": "eca2a7aa-5e61-569e-889e-8bc223ef5e36",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: SPC XL\n- Companies: Microsoft\n- Concepts: statistical analysis, control charts, process capability, histograms, Pareto charts\n- People: Vilfredo Pareto\n\nFacts:\n- SPC XL is a statistical add-in for Microsoft Excel.\n- SPC XL provides statistical analysis that includes control charts, process capability, histograms, and Pareto charts.\n- A Pareto chart contains bars and a line graph, with individual values shown in descending order by bars and the cumulative total shown by the line.\n- Vilfredo Pareto is the namesake of the Pareto chart.",
